   "slug": "sol61-vs-sonnet-board-8",
   "title": "One word from the miracle",
   "blurb": "Sonnet trails 5 to 1. Sol needs one more word and will almost surely get it next turn. Sonnet's spymaster says SQUEEZE 5. Its guesser finds LEMON, HAND, OIL and ORGAN, all correct. One word from a comeback, it picks WASHER. WASHER is the assassin."
