  {
   "slug": "sol61-vs-astra-board-9",
   "title": "The clean comeback",
   "blurb": "Sol falls behind 5 to 2 after Astra's STICKY 3 and COMMITTEE 2. Sol answers with SUPERHERO 3: COMIC, AMAZON, FIRE. Astra's guesser then stumbles on a civilian, and Sol closes it out with CARNIVAL 2."
  },
  {
   "slug": "opus-vs-astra-board-7",
   "title": "Saved by the assassin",
   "blurb": "Opus trails 5 to 2 and swings with KRISHNA 3: INDIA, FLUTE, TEMPLE. Level at 2 to 2, Astra says WONDERLAND 2. RABBIT is right. DECK is the assassin, and Opus wins without taking another turn."
  },
  {
   "slug": "sonnet-vs-sol61-board-12",
   "title": "Six words, one too many",
   "blurb": "Sonnet trails 6 to 1 and gives the biggest clue of the whole tournament: PAPER 6. NOVEL, BOARD, BOTTLE and PARACHUTE are all right. The fifth pick, SHOP, is Sol's last word, and revealing it hands Sol the game."
